## Service Architecture

```yaml
# docker-compose.yml services
services:
  # === Core Infrastructure ===
  timescaledb:         # Port 5432 - Time-series database
  redis:               # Port 6379 - Message broker + cache
  
  # === Application Services ===
  scraper:             # LotusBook odds scraper
  enricher:            # Cricbuzz match stats
  feature-pipeline:    # Feature computation
  rl-trainer:          # RL agent training
  backend:             # Port 8000 - FastAPI REST + WebSocket
  frontend:            # Port 3000 - Next.js dashboard
  
  # === Monitoring ===
  prometheus:          # Port 9090 - Metrics
  grafana:             # Port 3001 - Dashboards
```

