## Monitoring & Health Checks

### API Health Endpoint
```json
GET /api/health
{
    "status": "healthy",
    "redis": "connected",
    "database": "connected",
    "scraper_status": "active",
    "scraper_last_update_seconds": 3.2,
    "agent_state": "training",
    "agent_version": "ppo_v1_500k",
    "timestamp": "2026-02-07T..."
}
```

### Critical Alerts
```yaml
# Scraper alerts
- ScraperDown: No data for 60 seconds during live match
- StaleData: Last update > 30 seconds

# RL alerts  
- TrainingDiverged: Policy loss > 10x baseline
- RewardCollapse: Episode reward drops below -100

# Infrastructure
- DatabaseConnectionFailed: TimescaleDB unreachable
- RedisDown: Redis not responding
- HighMemory: > 90% usage
- DiskFull: < 5% free space
```

### Grafana Dashboards

**1. Data Pipeline Health**
- Scraper events/second
- Parse success rate
- Data freshness per match
- Redis queue depth

**2. RL Training Progress**
- Episode reward over time
- Win rate rolling average
- Action distribution
- Loss curves (policy, value, entropy)

**3. Virtual Trading P&L**
- Cumulative P&L chart
- Daily P&L heatmap
- Win rate by time of day
- Graduation progress

