## Backup & Recovery

### Data Backup
- TimescaleDB: pg_dump daily (odds data is valuable training data)
- Redis: RDB snapshots every 15 minutes
- Model checkpoints: Git LFS or S3

### Recovery Procedures
```powershell
# Redis recovery
docker exec phoenix-redis redis-cli --rdb /data/backup.rdb

# TimescaleDB recovery
pg_restore -h localhost -U phoenix -d phoenix_betting backup.dump

# Model recovery
# Models are versioned in models/checkpoints/
# Revert to last known good model
```

## Security Checklist
- [ ] Never commit `.env` files
- [ ] Use strong database passwords
- [ ] CORS restricted to specific origins in production
- [ ] API authentication enabled for production
- [ ] Scraper uses randomized fingerprints
- [ ] Model files not committed to git (use .gitignore)

